 "standard_code": "第一学段 · 数与运算",
 "standard_url": "http://www.moe.gov.cn/srcsite/A26/s8001/202204/t20220420_619921.html",
 "standard_text": "认识万以内的数，理解数位的含义；能计算 100 以内的加减法和简单的万以内加减法；理解乘法和除法的意义，掌握表内乘除法，会算有余数的除法（课标内容要求摘要）",
 "meta_desc": "二年级数学“估算”练习题：接近哪个整十数、大约几十几百、估算加减、钱够不够、用估算检查答案，100题在线练习，附可打印答案。",
 "key_big": "把数看成接近的整十、整百数再算",
 "key_sub": "398 ＋ 205 大约是 400 ＋ 200 ＝ 600。",
 "body_html": "<h2>怎么想</h2><p><b>估算</b>：不用算得很准，先把数变成接近的整十或整百，算出“大约”多少。</p><p>看下一位：48 比较接近 50；312 比较接近 300。<div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 312 56' width='312' height='56' role='img' aria-label='数轴'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='6' y1='16' x2='306' y2='16' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2.5'/><line x1='26' y1='9' x2='26' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='26.0' y='46.0' font-size='18' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>40</text><line x1='52' y1='9' x2='52' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='78' y1='9' x2='78' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='104' y1='9' x2='104' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='130' y1='9' x2='130' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='156' y1='9' x2='156' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='182' y1='9' x2='182' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='208' y1='9' x2='208' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='234' y1='9' x2='234' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='234.0' y='46.0' font-size='18' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>48</text><line x1='260' y1='9' x2='260' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='286' y1='9' x2='286' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='286.0' y='46.0' font-size='18' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>50</text></g></svg></div></p><p>估算可以很快判断钱够不够、答案合不合理。</p><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例题</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>298 ＋ 405 大约是多少？</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>298 大约 300，405 大约 400。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：大约 700</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例题</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>带 500 元，买 189 元和 276 元的东西够吗？</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>大约 200 ＋ 300 ＝ 500。</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>准确是 465。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：够</p></div><h2>常见错误</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>常见错误</th><th>正确的想法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>48 估成 40</td><td>48 比较接近 50</td></tr><tr><td>估算后还写准确的答案</td><td>估算写“大约”多少</td></tr><tr><td>算完不检查</td><td>用估算看答案合不合理</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
 "faq": [
  {
   "q": "什么时候用估算？",
